<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh March industry output rises 9.1 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Kazakh March industry output rises 9.1 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's industrial production rose 9.1 percent in March compared to a fall in production of 0.5 percent in February, the State Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>  KAZAKHSTAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   Mar 97    Feb 97    Jan-Mar 97</p>
<p>  month-on-month pct change	+9.1	-0.5	  +1.2</p>
<p>  year-on-year pct change	  +3.1	+0.4	   n/a</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
